These two abbreviations don't give the same result:
	let asdfasdf = "xyz\<Left>"
	cabbr XXX <C-R>=asdfasdf<CR>
	cabbr YYY xyz<Left>

Michael Dietrich: maximized gvim sometimes displays output of external command
