Patch 6.1.348
Problem:    Wildmode with wildmenu: ":set wildmode=list,full", ":colorscheme
	    <tab>" results in "zellner" instead of the first entry. (Anand
	    Hariharan)
Solution:   Don't call ExpandOne() from globpath(). (Flemming Madsen)
