New Keymaps: ~

Sinhala (Sri Lanka) (Harshula Jayasuriya)
Tamil in TSCII encoding (Yegappan Lakshmanan)
Greek in cp737 (Panagiotis Louridas)
Polish-slash (HS6_06)
